ss the enterprise application landscape.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eThis role executes the enterprise data strategy defined by the Enterprise Data Architect, translating architecture standards, governance rules, and target-state designs into reliable, production-grade data solutions that support analytics, AI/ML, operational reporting, and downstream integrations.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eThe Data Engineer works handson with SAP systems, Salesforce CRM, Pricing and Quoting platform, MES platforms, middleware/integration tools, and cloud data platforms, ensuring enterprise data is trustworthy, accessible, and compliant.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Responsibilities\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e Data Pipeline Engineering \u0026 Integration\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003eDesign, implement, and maintain batch and near–real-time data pipelines from:\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eSAP ECC / S/4HANA (IDocs, extractors, CDS views, APIs),Salesforce CRM, Pricing and quoting platform, Multiple MES systems , External and third-party data sources\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eImplement ETL/ELT pipelines using enterprise-approved tools and cloud services\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eEnsure reliable orchestration, monitoring, error handling, and recovery of data flows\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eOptimize performance, scalability, and cost efficiency of data ingestion processes\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e Enterprise Data Platform Development\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuild And Operate Enterprise Data Platforms Such As\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eCloud data warehouses / data lakes MS Azure and SAP Business Data Cloud or related data product,SAP BW / analytics backends,\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImplement Data Models (raw, Curated, Semantic Layers) Aligned With\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eEnterprise canonical models\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eBusiness domains (Sales, Finance, Operations, Manufacturing, Supply Chain)\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eEnable analytics, reporting, AI/ML, and self-service BI use cases\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e Data Quality, Reliability \u0026 Observability\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003eImplement data quality controls, validation rules, reconciliation checks, and alerts. Monitor data freshness, completeness, accuracy, and consistency\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eSupport root cause analysis for data issues across source systems and pipelines\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eEnsure SLAs are met for business-critical datasets\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e Data Governance \u0026 Security Implementation\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003eEnforce data governance standards defined by the Enterprise Data Architect, including:\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eData ownership and stewardship models,Master data alignment (customer, product, pricing, supplier)\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eMetadata, lineage, and documentation standards\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImplement Security, Privacy, And Compliance Controls\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eRole-based access control (RBAC),Data masking and encryption,GDPR and regulatory requirements\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eSupport audits and compliance assessments related to enterprise data\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e Collaboration with Enterprise Architecture \u0026 Stakeholders\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWork Closely With The Enterprise Data Architect To\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eTranslate architecture blueprints into implementable solutions,Contribute to roadmap execution and platform evolution\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCollaborate With\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eApplication teams (SAP, Salesforce, MES)\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eIntegration teams (e.g., MuleSoft, SAP BTP Integration Suite)\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eAnalytics, BI, and Data Science teams\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eBusiness stakeholders and process owners\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eProvide technical input to project design, demand intake, and solution reviews\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e DevOps, Automation \u0026 Best Practices\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApply DataOps And DevOps Practices\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eCI/CD for data pipelines\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eInfrastructure-as-code (IaC) where applicable\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eVersion control and automated testing\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eDocument pipelines, models, and operational procedures\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eContinuously improve reliability, performance, and maintainability\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEducation\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRequired Qualifications\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eBachelor's or Master's degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Data Engineering, or related field\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTechnical Skills \u0026 Experience\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eStrong hands-on experience in data engineering (typically 5–8+ years)\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSolid Experience With\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eSAP data sources (ECC/S4 tables, CDS views, extractors, APIs)\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eSalesforce data model and APIs\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eEnterprise integration platforms (e.g., MuleSoft, SAP BTP Integration Suite)\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProficiency In\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eSQL (advanced)\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003ePython, Spark, or equivalent data processing frameworks\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExperience With\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eCloud data warehouses and data lakes\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eDimensional and domain-oriented data modeling\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eData quality and observability frameworks\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eDeveloping data ingest and semantic models within the data lake\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFamiliarity With\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eManufacturing and MES data structures\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eERP, CRM, and pricing data domains\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eGovernance \u0026 Enterprise Skills\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eExperience implementing enterprise data governance rules (not just defining them)\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eUnderstanding of master data concepts and cross-system alignment\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eAbility to work within enterprise architecture standards and reference models\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePreferred Qualifications\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eExperience in SAP-centered enterprises\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExposure To\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eAI/ML data enablement\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eStreaming platforms (e.g., Kafka, Event Hub)\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eSAP Datasphere, BW/4HANA, or SAC integrations\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eKnowledge of FinOps / cost optimization for data platforms\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eExperience working in global, multi-region environments\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat Can We Offer You For Your Talent\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eVishay offers a comprehensive suite of benefit programs including health care coverage, financial support programs and other resources designed to hel